{"id":"adf383c642517545","group":"58","path":"58/batch07/58-cor-determinacy.md","title":"AD Corollary","display":"cor-determinacy — AD Corollary","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-cor-determinacy","aliases":["58-cor-determinacy"],"display":"cor-determinacy — AD Corollary","depends_on":["[[../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md]]","[[58-df-cardinal]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-cor-determinacy"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-cor-determinacy</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-determinacy — AD Corollary"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"4cc4baec9297fd1e\" href=\"?note=4cc4baec9297fd1e\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md\">../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"58-df-cardinal\">58-df-cardinal</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"263e6b700ce2f25e\" href=\"?note=263e6b700ce2f25e\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:\\mathbb R\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\omega^\\omega\">\\(c:\\mathbb R\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\omega^\\omega\\)</span> (fixed coding of reals by Baire-space plays)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Det}(T,A,M)\">\\(\\mathrm{Det}(T,A,M)\\)</span> (determinacy predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"4cc4baec9297fd1e\" href=\"?note=4cc4baec9297fd1e\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md\">../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ord}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ord}\\)</span> (class of ordinals, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{DependentChoiceSequence}_S(x,R,X)\">\\(\\mathrm{DependentChoiceSequence}_S(x,R,X)\\)</span> (dependent-choice sequence predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"263e6b700ce2f25e\" href=\"?note=263e6b700ce2f25e\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence.md\">../batch20/58-df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta=\\sup\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\exists f\\;(f:\\mathbb R\\twoheadrightarrow\\alpha)\\}\">\\(\\Theta=\\sup\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\exists f\\;(f:\\mathbb R\\twoheadrightarrow\\alpha)\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}determinacy}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\Biggl(\nc:\\mathbb R\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\omega^\\omega\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\\mathrm{Det}(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},c[A],\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall X\\in V\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathcal P(X\\times X)\\;\\Bigl(\nX\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall a\\in X\\;\\exists b\\in X\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\forall a_0\\in X\\;\\exists x\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{DependentChoiceSequence}_S(x,R,X)\\land x(0)=a_0\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\Theta=\\sup\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\exists f\\;(f:\\mathbb R\\twoheadrightarrow\\alpha)\\}\n\\Biggr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Biggl(\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\\mathrm{Det}(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},c[A],\\omega)\n\\land\\neg\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists f\\;(f:\\mathbb R\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\alpha)\n\\land\\aleph_1&lt;\\Theta\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}determinacy}\\vdash{}&amp;\n\\Biggl(\nc:\\mathbb R\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\omega^\\omega\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\\mathrm{Det}(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},c[A],\\omega)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\forall X\\in V\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathcal P(X\\times X)\\;\\Bigl(\nX\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall a\\in X\\;\\exists b\\in X\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\to\\forall a_0\\in X\\;\\exists x\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{DependentChoiceSequence}_S(x,R,X)\\land x(0)=a_0\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\land\\Theta=\\sup\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\exists f\\;(f:\\mathbb R\\twoheadrightarrow\\alpha)\\}\n\\Biggr)\\\\\n&amp;\\to\\Biggl(\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\\mathrm{Det}(\\omega^{&lt;\\omega},c[A],\\omega)\n\\land\\neg\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists f\\;(f:\\mathbb R\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\alpha)\n\\land\\aleph_1&lt;\\Theta\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The first universal clause is the real-game instance of AD under the fixed coding <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c\">\\(c\\)</span>; the second universal clause expands dependent choice through actual <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"R\">\\(R\\)</span>-chains.</li>\n<li>The formula records only the displayed consequences of <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AD}+\\mathrm{DC}\">\\(\\mathrm{AD}+\\mathrm{DC}\\)</span>; it does not claim that every cardinal below <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span> is regular or otherwise uniformly &quot;well-behaved.&quot;</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Theta\">\\(\\Theta\\)</span> is fixed by its defining supremum, and non-well-orderability is expanded rather than hidden behind an undefined predicate.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md","status":"resolved","id":"4cc4baec9297fd1e","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-cardinal","status":"resolved","id":"5fb1c2241d1943d1","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-cardinal]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"263e6b700ce2f25e","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md","status":"resolved","id":"4cc4baec9297fd1e","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Det}(T,A,M)$ (determinacy predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-determinacy.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ord}$ (class of ordinals, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence.md","status":"resolved","id":"263e6b700ce2f25e","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{DependentChoiceSequence}_S(x,R,X)$ (dependent-choice sequence predicate, see [[../batch20/58-df-zfc-dependent-choice-sequence.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"c:\\mathbb R\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\omega^\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Det}(T,A,M)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ord}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{DependentChoiceSequence}_S(x,R,X)","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta=\\sup\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\exists f\\;(f:\\mathbb R\\twoheadrightarrow\\alpha)\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}determinacy}\\vdash{}&\n\\Biggl(\nc:\\mathbb R\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\omega^\\omega\n\\land\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\\mathrm{Det}(\\omega^{<\\omega},c[A],\\omega)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\forall X\\in V\\;\\forall R\\in\\mathcal P(X\\times X)\\;\\Bigl(\nX\\neq\\emptyset\\land\\forall a\\in X\\;\\exists b\\in X\\;(\\langle a,b\\rangle\\in R)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\to\\forall a_0\\in X\\;\\exists x\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{DependentChoiceSequence}_S(x,R,X)\\land x(0)=a_0\n\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\quad\\land\\Theta=\\sup\\{\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}:\\exists f\\;(f:\\mathbb R\\twoheadrightarrow\\alpha)\\}\n\\Biggr)\\\\\n&\\to\\Biggl(\n\\forall A\\subseteq\\mathbb R\\;\\mathrm{Det}(\\omega^{<\\omega},c[A],\\omega)\n\\land\\neg\\exists\\alpha\\in\\mathrm{Ord}\\;\\exists f\\;(f:\\mathbb R\\xrightarrow{\\sim}\\alpha)\n\\land\\aleph_1<\\Theta\n\\Biggr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"c","display":false},{"tex":"R","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AD}+\\mathrm{DC}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\Theta","display":false}],"bytes":2181,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-49","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch07/58-cor-determinacy.md|58-cor-determinacy]]（batch07）"}],"outgoing":["4cc4baec9297fd1e","5fb1c2241d1943d1","5582a281f15a33c2","263e6b700ce2f25e"]}